    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_09",
      "hash64": "1F17BE3F0FC027BC",
      "text": "Excellent question, Velly! It’s very simple. You\\nsee, the reason is...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_10",
      "hash64": "1F14413F0FBD1D7E",
      "text": "...Uh, hm. Why DID I put in that request?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
